1
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:12,080
=Fatal Proximity to Him=

2
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:14,120
=Episode 5=

3
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:16,080
Then bear with it.

4
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,400
Unbelievable.

5
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,480
You're still complaining
while I'm patching you up?

6
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,120
I'm satisfied. Of course I am.

7
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:23,680
But

8
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,480
it's really tight.

9
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:26,320
I don't care.

10
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:27,960
Deal with it.

11
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:34,800
Spit it out.

12
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:35,880
You're interrupting my game.

13
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,000
Hey, Sheng.

14
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:39,600
Can I crash at your
internet cafe tonight?

15
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:40,600
Why?

16
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:41,720
You've got the billiards hall.

17
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:42,600
Why come sleep here?

18
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:44,040
Ask your little brother.

19
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,240
He brought his girlfriend over.

20
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,080
If I stay,

21
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:47,240
I'll just be in their way.

22
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:49,560
Fine.

23
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:50,080
Got it.

24
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,640
No wonder we had a traitor in our midst.

25
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:02,680
My acting's getting better too.

26
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,640
Next time I see your mom,

27
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:05,880
I won't even need a script.

28
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:08,040
Ms. Lin said it herself.

29
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:08,960
The Oscars

30
00:01:09,120 --> 00:01:10,160
owe you a trophy.

31
00:01:16,840 --> 00:01:17,320
He Lan,

32
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:18,800
got yourself a girlfriend?

33
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:20,880
Li Junsheng,

34
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,200
what do you want?

35
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:23,440
Give me the money,

36
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:25,120
and I'll let bygones be bygones.

37
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:26,560
(He Lan...)

38
00:01:26,960 --> 00:01:29,440
(Do you have any friends
besides enemies?)

39
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:30,520
You won't give it to me?

40
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:32,840
Then...

41
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,720
I'll have your little girlfriend pay me.

42
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,480
You dare hit me?

43
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:42,600
Looks like your dad

44
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:44,320
hasn't beaten enough sense into you.

45
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:45,600
You deserve a nice beating.

46
00:01:46,360 --> 00:01:47,800
Nothing but filth comes
out of your mouth.

47
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,560
That's enough.

48
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:57,320
He Lan!

49
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,360
Are you okay?

50
00:01:59,080 --> 00:01:59,640
Does it hurt?

51
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:00,800
I'm fine.

52
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:01,760
Go to school.

53
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:02,240
I'll handle this.

54
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:03,360
I'll be fine.

55
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,120
Emergency service?

56
00:02:08,720 --> 00:02:09,680
There's a fight

57
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:10,720
in Youyi Alley on Fuxing Road.

58
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:13,720
(Academic Building)

59
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:15,360
Today we're going to cover...

60
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:20,360
He Lan's already been expelled once.

61
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,160
Now he's gotten into another fight.

62
00:02:22,560 --> 00:02:23,680
Do you think he'll get expelled again?

63
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,800
His grades are way too good.

64
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:26,560
Unless

65
00:02:26,600 --> 00:02:28,160
he gets caught breaking the law
or school rules,

66
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:29,880
the school won't let him go.

67
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,080
Honey,

68
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:51,360
look what He Lan did to him!

69
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:54,640
I heard He Lan got himself a girlfriend.

70
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,280
He stole the eighteen thousand
from your card.

71
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,680
He must've spent it on that girl.

72
00:02:58,280 --> 00:02:59,560
So I went to get the money back
from her.

73
00:02:59,920 --> 00:03:00,560
And then

74
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:03,040
he nearly beat me to death.

75
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,200
Stop right there!

76
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,680
No matter what,

77
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:12,840
we're still family.

78
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,400
Look at

79
00:03:13,440 --> 00:03:15,040
what you did to your brother.

80
00:03:15,240 --> 00:03:16,560
Honey,

81
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:19,720
being a stepmother is impossible!

82
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:21,040
If I'm too strict,

83
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:23,200
people say I'm abusing my stepson.

84
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,320
But if I'm too easy on him,

85
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,080
he

86
00:03:25,320 --> 00:03:25,960
won't listen

87
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,600
and starts going down the wrong path.

88
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:28,400
Honey,

89
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:30,120
you need to deal with him yourself.

90
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,040
Whatever else he's done,

91
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:31,960
stealing money

92
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:33,200
is a serious problem.

93
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:35,120
That money was left to me
when Grandma died.

94
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:37,040
You're the one who took my money.

95
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:37,640
And another thing.

96
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,080
Even that necklace you're wearing

97
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:41,000
was made by melting down
my mom's ring and earrings.

98
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:41,760
You know that well.

99
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:43,720
Honey!

100
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,920
Do you hear the way he's talking to me?

101
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:48,360
Does he even see Junsheng
and me as family?

102
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:50,040
You need to do something about him.

103
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:53,800
Ugh, my head...

104
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:56,880
Get inside!

105
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,880
I'll beat the crap out of you!

106
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:00,960
Are you sorry now?

107
00:04:02,320 --> 00:04:03,520
You put that kid in the hospital.

108
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:04,800
Do you know how much

109
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:06,400
we had to pay to settle that mess?

110
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:07,360
And now you're stealing?

111
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,280
From your own family?

112
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,000
I told you, it wasn't me.

113
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:12,000
It was Li Junsheng!

114
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,720
Still won't admit it?

115
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:14,600
Now you're blaming Li Junsheng?

116
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:15,640
Junsheng's

117
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,360
grades may not be as good as yours,

118
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:19,480
but at least he doesn't have
all these bad habits.

119
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,720
Exactly, Dad.

120
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:22,040
I tell him to straighten up every day,

121
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:22,840
but he never listens!

122
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:24,640
This time you stole money,

123
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,360
and the bank

124
00:04:25,520 --> 00:04:26,320
caught you on camera, didn't they?

125
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,280
And you're still trying to pin it
on Junsheng?

126
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:29,320
Have you no shame?

127
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,040
Tell me,

128
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,360
where did that eighteen thousand go?

129
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,280
I spent it.

130
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,120
Look at him.

131
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,640
He's never going to straighten out.

132
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,080
Hit him!

133
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,480
Beat him until he learns!

134
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,440
What's wrong?

135
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:48,440
Don't feel like eating?

136
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:49,760
I can't eat.

137
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:52,760
Then don't force yourself.

138
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:53,720
Go get some sleep.

139
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,440
I'm working the night shift.

140
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:57,520
Make sure you lock the door.

141
00:04:57,880 --> 00:05:00,240
I'll bring breakfast back from
the hospital cafeteria tomorrow morning.

142
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:00,720
Okay.

143
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:06,400
♪I hide my racing heart without a sound♪

144
00:05:08,320 --> 00:05:12,480
♪I close my eyes and pretend
the story's been reset♪

145
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:12,920
(He Lan!)

146
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:13,960
(Are you okay?)

147
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,520
(I'm not worried about him.)

148
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:19,320
(I just need to make sure I stay alive.)

149
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:23,160
♪I thought if I didn't hear, see,
or speak of you♪

150
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:26,640
♪I could cut every thread
that ties us together♪

151
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:32,880
♪Through the endless night,
I guard my only secret♪

152
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:34,360
(Luo Xiyu)

153
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,440
(Are you still at the police station?)

154
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:37,400
(Are you home yet?)

155
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:38,520
(Did your dad hit you?)

156
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:40,120
(You're not going to the billiards
hall today, right?)

157
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:42,720
♪I tried to erase the fire we once had♪

158
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:46,600
♪But I can't erase your name
carved into my bones♪

159
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:49,440
♪The more I try to leave you behind♪

160
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:53,560
♪The deeper I sink with no end in sight♪

161
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:56,440
♪What if I stayed a little farther away♪

162
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:59,840
♪Could I finally break free
from this cycle♪

163
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:02,240
♪What if I took things a little slower♪

164
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:06,240
♪Could I delay the moment
everything falls apart♪

165
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:08,480
♪Maybe if I retreat to the edge
of my dreams♪

166
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,160
Zhang Jinghang really got you
twenty grand.

167
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:11,800
Thank you.

168
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:13,400
I'll definitely pay you back.

169
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,360
(She even insisted on paying me back
for two hand warmers.)

170
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,680
(Isn't she being a little too formal
with me?)

171
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:17,440
No, you don't have to.

172
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,040
I'm just glad I could help.

173
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:22,120
♪Even if I never want to see you again♪

174
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:23,760
♪This nightmare still won't end♪

175
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:24,680
(I'm fine.)

176
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,720
(Remember to come to
the billiards hall tomorrow.)

177
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:31,280
♪Even if having you only leaves me
in your debt♪

178
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:32,000
(I asked around.)

179
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:32,800
(He Lan went home.)

180
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:35,440
(I heard the guy he fought
was his stepbrother.)

181
00:06:35,680 --> 00:06:37,360
No wonder Li Junsheng said that.

182
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:38,960
Looks like your dad

183
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:40,600
hasn't beaten enough sense into you.

184
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,800
You deserve a nice beating.

185
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,120
Nothing but filth comes
out of your mouth.

186
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:45,760
What if he gets his dad

187
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:47,200
to beat He Lan?

188
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:51,240
Send me He Lan's address

189
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:52,040
right now.

190
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:57,240
♪At least none of this was pretend♪

191
00:07:01,200 --> 00:07:01,880
(I'm fine.)

192
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:03,800
(Remember to come practice
at the billiards hall tomorrow.)

193
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:18,520
(Where's the ring Grandma gave me?)

194
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,240
(Didn't I always carry it with me?)

195
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,320
(It must've fallen)

196
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,640
(into Xiyu's bag during the fight.)

197
00:07:46,880 --> 00:07:47,640
(Run the Table)
Very good.

198
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:49,200
Xiyu,

199
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:50,160
don't be nervous.

200
00:07:50,600 --> 00:07:51,840
Keep this up,

201
00:07:51,880 --> 00:07:53,200
and you'll do fine on the exam.

202
00:07:53,360 --> 00:07:55,080
I just can't help getting nervous.

203
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,120
An exam

204
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,360
isn't just about skill.

205
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,280
It's about mindset too.

206
00:07:58,720 --> 00:07:59,400
But...

207
00:07:59,760 --> 00:08:01,640
Don't you want to become
a principal dancer someday?

208
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:04,360
You'll have to perform
in front of thousands of people.

209
00:08:04,720 --> 00:08:06,160
Right now, you're only dancing
in front of your teacher.

210
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,200
He Lan is right.

211
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:10,120
As a professional dancer,

212
00:08:10,200 --> 00:08:11,280
just like an athlete,

213
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:12,560
you'll face injuries

214
00:08:12,960 --> 00:08:13,840
and have to overcome them.

215
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:16,120
It's an unavoidable part of the career.

216
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,400
Xiyu,

217
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:19,120
as your teacher,

218
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:21,200
this is as far as I can take you.

219
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:22,600
From here on,

220
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:24,680
you'll meet more accomplished teachers

221
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:26,000
and reach bigger stages.

222
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:27,880
You're going to soar.

223
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:29,840
Ms. Lin,

224
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,040
thank you so much.

225
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:35,400
I've already caused you so much trouble,

226
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:37,920
and I even made you sneak around
with us.

227
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,120
I'll be waiting

228
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:43,840
for you to bring me your
Dance Academy acceptance letter.

229
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:44,920
You got this.

230
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:46,360
I will.

231
00:08:55,920 --> 00:08:57,000
Hurry! We're gonna be late.

232
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:57,760
Coming!

233
00:08:57,760 --> 00:08:58,720
First period is
the homeroom teacher's class.

234
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:00,600
Let's go.

235
00:09:00,680 --> 00:09:01,320
Let's go.

236
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:18,880
(Luo Xiyu - 2014 Central Dance Academy
Entrance Exam Admission Ticket)

237
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:22,440
All done.

238
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:23,160
You can go.

239
00:09:25,640 --> 00:09:26,400
Next.

240
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,080
Hey, Ms. Luo.

241
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:31,560
Shuqi?

242
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:32,840
What's wrong?

243
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:36,960
I... um...

244
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:38,880
My stomach hurts a little.

245
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,480
How long has this been going on?

246
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:43,400
Quite a while.

247
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:44,760
Quite a while?

248
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,040
Then let's do an endoscopy.

249
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,800
Oh, that's okay. No need.

250
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:50,560
Maybe

251
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:53,120
I just haven't been eating properly
because my arts exam is coming up.

252
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:54,680
How about this?

253
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:55,560
Could you

254
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:56,360
just prescribe me

255
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:57,320
something for my stomach?

256
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,200
I'll try that first.

257
00:09:58,560 --> 00:09:59,000
Okay.

258
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,520
I'll prescribe you

259
00:10:00,520 --> 00:10:01,440
some medicine first.

260
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:03,400
If you're still having problems
after taking it,

261
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,680
come back and see me, okay?

262
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:09,120
Oh, right.

263
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,240
I was at the print shop
by the school gate today,

264
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:14,360
and saw that Luo Xiyu
left her exam ticket there.

265
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,040
Oh, that girl.

266
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:15,880
So I brought it over for you.

267
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,120
Her exam

268
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,280
(Luo Xiyu Exam Admission Ticket)
is tomorrow.

269
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:20,400
She can't afford to miss it.

270
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,320
(Dance Major?)

271
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:44,040
♪I thought♪

272
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:46,880
♪If we stayed apart a little longer♪

273
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:49,320
♪We'd each find our way♪

274
00:10:49,320 --> 00:10:51,080
♪Into a brand-new world♪

275
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:53,680
♪But somehow, every time♪

276
00:10:53,680 --> 00:10:55,480
♪I meet you again♪

277
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:57,200
♪And every reunion becomes♪

278
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:59,720
♪Another way of letting go♪

279
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:01,200
♪The promises♪

280
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:04,040
♪We couldn't keep in this life♪

281
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:05,160
♪Why should♪

282
